---
// Small one-line "Sponsor this directory" pointer. Placed at the bottom of
// entry pages so projects browsing their own listing see the offer without
// us bloating the page. Visually small + low-contrast so it never competes
// with the editorial sell-block above.
---
<p class="sponsor-link">
  Are you a project running an airdrop?
  <a href="/sponsor">Sponsor this directory →</a>
</p>

<style>
  .sponsor-link {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    background: rgba(217, 212, 196, 0.25);
    border: 1px dashed var(--rule, #d9d4c4);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft, #555);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .sponsor-link a {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
